WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Alright team, kicking off the requirements review.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
First topic: we need to redesign the dashboard so users can filter by date range.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Acceptance criteria: filter must support last 7 days, last 30 days, and custom range.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Second item: the export feature is too slow. We should chunk the queries on the server.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Decision: we'll cap export size at 10k rows per chunk and stream the response.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Action item: Sarah owns the chunking work, due end of sprint.
